<h2>7. Step-by-Step Testing & User Guide</h2>

<h3>Scenario 1: HR Admin / Manager Sets a New Quarterly Goal</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Navigate to <strong>Sidebar &rarr; Performance &rarr; Goals & KPIs</strong>.</li>
  <li>Select <strong>Q1 (Jan - Mar)</strong> tab and year <strong>2026</strong>.</li>
  <li>Click <strong>"Add Quarterly Goal"</strong>.</li>
  <li>Choose Department (e.g. <em>Engineering</em>) and Assignee (e.g. <em>Gauri Dhapte</em>).</li>
  <li>Enter Goal Title (e.g. <em>"Real-Time WebSocket Notifications"</em>), Metric (<em>"Zero drop rate"</em>), Weightage (<em>25%</em>), Due Date.</li>
  <li>Click <strong>"Assign Goal"</strong> &rarr; The goal appears in the list with <span class="badge badge-teal">Set by HR</span> badge.</li>
</ol>

<h3>Scenario 2: Employee Updates Goal Progress</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Employee logs into HRMS.</li>
  <li>Navigates to <strong>Goals & KPIs</strong> and locates assigned goal.</li>
  <li>Clicks <strong>"Update Progress"</strong>.</li>
  <li>Adjusts the slider from 80% to 100%, updates current metric, and adds a note: <em>"Deployed to staging and verified all test suites."</em></li>
  <li>Clicks <strong>"Save Progress"</strong> &rarr; Progress bar updates immediately to 100% and status marks <span class="badge badge-green">Completed</span>.</li>
</ol>

<h3>Scenario 3: Employee Submits Self-Review & Manager Evaluates</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Navigate to <strong>Sidebar &rarr; Performance &rarr; Appraisals</strong>.</li>
  <li>The employee sees their dynamically calculated <strong>KPI Score</strong> (e.g., 94%).</li>
  <li>Click <strong>"Self Review"</strong>, select <code>4.5 - Outstanding</code>, enter achievements, and submit.</li>
  <li>Line Manager logs in, opens Appraisals, clicks <strong>"Evaluate"</strong>.</li>
  <li>Enters Manager Rating (<code>4.7</code>), confirms KPI score, enters developmental feedback, and clicks <strong>"Complete Appraisal"</strong>.</li>
  <li>Status transitions to <span class="badge badge-green">Completed</span> and final balanced overall rating updates to <strong>4.6 / 5.0</strong>.</li>
</ol>

<h3>Scenario 4: Submitting 360° Peer Feedback</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Navigate to <strong>Sidebar &rarr; Performance &rarr; 360° Feedback</strong>.</li>
  <li>Click <strong>"Give 360 Feedback"</strong>.</li>
  <li>Select colleague, select relationship (<em>Peer / Teammate</em>).</li>
  <li>Score the 4 competencies (Technical: 5, Delivery: 4, Teamwork: 5, Communication: 5).</li>
  <li>Write Core Strengths and Growth Areas, then click <strong>"Submit Review"</strong>.</li>
</ol>

<h3>Scenario 5: Viewing Performance Reports & Exporting PDF</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Navigate to <strong>Sidebar &rarr; Performance &rarr; Reports</strong>.</li>
  <li>Select <strong>Q1 2026</strong> tab.</li>
  <li>Review the real department averages, rating distribution, and Top 5 Performers leaderboard.</li>
  <li>Click <strong>"Export Executive PDF"</strong> &rarr; A cleanly formatted PDF is automatically downloaded to the computer.</li>
</ol>

<h2>8. Technical REST API Reference</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Endpoint</th>
      <th>Method</th>
      <th>Access Role</th>
      <th>Description</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><code>/api/goals</code></td>
      <td>GET</td>
      <td>All Authenticated</td>
      <td>Query by <code>quarter</code>, <code>year</code>, <code>departmentId</code>, <code>userId</code>. Employees see their own goals; Managers/HR see team/all.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>/api/goals</code></td>
      <td>POST</td>
      <td>HR, Manager, Admin</td>
      <td>Creates a quarterly goal with KPI metric, weightage, target value, and creator attribution.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>/api/goals/:id</code></td>
      <td>PUT</td>
      <td>Assignee, Manager, HR</td>
      <td>Updates goal progress (%), current value, status, employee notes, and manager feedback.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>/api/goals/:id</code></td>
      <td>DELETE</td>
      <td>HR, Manager, Admin</td>
      <td>Deletes an objective.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>/api/appraisals</code></td>
      <td>GET</td>
      <td>All Authenticated</td>
      <td>Query by <code>quarter</code>, <code>year</code>, <code>departmentId</code>, <code>userId</code>. Returns KPI scores and review status.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>/api/appraisals</code></td>
      <td>POST</td>
      <td>All Authenticated</td>
      <td>Initializes or creates appraisal record.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>/api/appraisals/:id</code></td>
      <td>PUT</td>
      <td>Assignee, Line Manager, HR</td>
      <td>Submits employee self-review or manager evaluation and calculates overall rating.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>/api/feedback</code></td>
      <td>GET</td>
      <td>All Authenticated</td>
      <td>Query by <code>quarter</code>, <code>year</code>, <code>employeeId</code>, <code>reviewerId</code>.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>/api/feedback</code></td>
      <td>POST</td>
      <td>All Authenticated</td>
      <td>Submits a 4-competency 360 feedback evaluation.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

